-03-09","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09#:~:text=The%20seeds%20of%20men%20are%20rotten.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Gaze Blank and Pitiless\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09-e23","era":null,"summary":"Kelse searches for Maeli, who has run off again, and recalls how Avacyn saved him months ago.","participants":["kelse","maeli"],"location":"kelse-s-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09","order":500,"story_date":"2016-03-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":140,"quote":"Kelse tried hard not to think of a few months ago, when he had run off.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09#:~:text=Kelse%20tried%20hard%20not,he%20had%20run%20off.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"A Gaze Blank and Pitiless","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ken Troop"],"date":"2016-03-09","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09#:~:text=Kelse%20tried%20hard%20not,he%20had%20run%20off.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"A Gaze Blank and Pitiless\" by Ken Troop. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 9 Mar 2016."}},{"id":"gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09-e24","era":null,"summary":"Angels appear over Kelse's village and begin killing villagers with spears, swords and fire.","participants":["angels-of-innistrad","kelse","maeli"],"location":"kelse-s-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/gaze-blank-and-pitiless-2016-03-09","order":500,"story_date":"2016-03-09","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":153,"quote":"Then one of the angels pointed her glowing spear downward at the village.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/gaze-bl